2025-10-13 14:26:29,573 - INFO - Function Requirement: Function Name: stock_price_analyzer
Description:
  Queries real-time stock market data to retrieve the current price of a specified stock symbol.
Parameters:
  None
Returns:
  float - current stock price for the symbol
Example:
  import requests

  def stock_price_analyzer(symbol: str) -> float:
      api_key = os.environ.get('STOCK_API_KEY')
      response = requests.get(f'https://api.stocks.com/v1/quote/{symbol}',
                            headers={'Authorization': f'Bearer {api_key}'})
      data = response.json()
      return float(data['price'])

  # Usage
  price = stock_price_analyzer('AAPL')
  print(f"Current price: ${price}")
